{
  "name": "WF1 - Stock Sync, Order Intake dan Digest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF1 - Jalur A: Sinkron Stok 15 Menit\n\nAlur: Jadwal -> (ambil daftar merchant + ambil katalog, paralel) -> GET stok per merchant (Retry On Fail, onError continueErrorOutput) -> sukses: normalisasi -> gabung katalog by sku -> ambil qty lama -> upsert idempotent. Gagal permanen: dead-letter + alert.\n\n**Periksa ulang setelah import:**\n- Node **Gabungkan Katalog** (Merge, combine by field `sku`): skema parameter Merge beda-beda antar versi n8n, buka node ini di editor dan pastikan mode = Combine > field `sku` = `sku`, Keep Matches.\n- `new_stockouts` di `ops.sync_runs` dihitung sebagai jumlah baris qty=0 pada batch sinkron ini (pendekatan), bukan transisi tepat dari >0 ke 0. Dokumentasikan penyederhanaan ini di docs/02.\n- Ambang \"Terlalu Lambat?\" (60000 ms) sengaja longgar; turunkan sementara untuk menguji alert (lihat guide/wf5).\n\n**TODO:**\n- [ ] Pilih credential Postgres `ops_writer` dan Header Auth Mock API di tiap node\n- [ ] Ganti `ISI_TOKEN_PUSH_KUMA` dengan token monitor Push kalian\n- [ ] Set Settings > Error Workflow = WF5 di workflow ini",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "sa-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note Jalur A",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1400, -820]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "*/15 * * * *" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1-jadwal-sinkron",
      "name": "Jadwal Sinkron 15 Menit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-1400, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const sd = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nsd.sync_start = Date.now();\nreturn [{ json: { sync_start: sd.sync_start } }];"
      },
      "id": "a1b-catat-waktu-mulai",
      "name": "Catat Waktu Mulai",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-1180, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT merchant_id FROM core.merchants WHERE active = true ORDER BY merchant_id;"
      },
